{"4129570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Orbit", "steam_appid": 4129570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Orbit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Orbit</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>roguelike space adventure</strong> where every planet brings new dangers, upgrades, and choices. Pilot your ship across the stars, battle alien forces, and build the ultimate vessel as you fight your way toward the final showdown on <strong>Planet 10</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your skills and strategy be enough to survive the journey and conquer the final boss?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet-to-Planet Progression:</strong> Every planet is generated! Who knows if you will face waves of ships, or land on a nice safe planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Ship Upgrades:</strong> Customize and enhance your ship with powerful weapons, more health, even shots that explode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Engage in fast, tactical battles where every decision counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Replayability:</strong> No two runs are ever the same — adapt, upgrade, and push further each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Final Boss:</strong> Test everything you’ve learned in a climactic battle for the fate of your ship and the galaxy.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Orbit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Orbit</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>roguelike space adventure</strong> where every planet brings new dangers, upgrades, and choices. Pilot your ship across the stars, battle alien forces, and build the ultimate vessel as you fight your way toward the final showdown on <strong>Planet 10</strong>.</p><p class=\"b